{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dragon Expedition is a fantasy adventure action game that tells the story of the Eastern world being controlled by an unidentified robot prophet. The girl unexpectedly becomes involved in this conspiracy and becomes a dragon slayer warrior, heading alone to the Western demon world to search for the Dragon Crystal and save her home. From then on, embark on the long journey of slaying demons and exploring treasures. In the game, there are high degree of freedom tasks for you to explore, exciting real-time battles for you to challenge, and rich side storylines that will trigger countless exciting adventures. Your choices will overturn your destiny and rewrite different endings. Is it defeating the dragon to save our home? Or was it conquered by evil forces, and the dragon slaying warrior eventually became a dragon? Only by embarking on a long journey and writing fate with a sword can we ultimately control our destiny!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">1. Control the flying dragon for high-altitude soaring and low altitude combat, and use various skills such as spewing flames and bombing shells to help you win with one strike.\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435310/extras/gif.gif?t=1744727284\" />  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435310/extras/\u641c\u72d7\u9ad8\u901f\u6d4f\u89c8\u5668\u622a\u56fe20250415204019.png?t=1744727284\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">2. Multi storyline and multiple endings, a high degree of freedom world for you to explore.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435310/extras/174832.png?t=1744727284\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435310/extras/0415203845.png?t=1744727284\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">3. Skill points can be freely matched, and real-time combat combos can be used to win.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435310/extras/517200.png?t=1744727284\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435310/extras/174604.png?t=1744727284\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">4. Bosses with different attributes are not only a test of strength, but also a competition of intelligence.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435310/extras/1243.png?t=1744727284\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435310/extras/20250221214630.png?t=1744727284\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435310/extras/25528.png?t=1744727284\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">5. Whether the Eastern world can return to its golden age and prosperity is all in your mind.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435310/extras/4205723.png?t=1744727284\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3435310?t=1744727284","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3435310?t=1744727284","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435310/28aabce627b17e0e049e08d78f6692376ab53835/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744727284","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435310/28aabce627b17e0e049e08d78f6692376ab53835/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744727284","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"descript